Conversation history:
{
  "historical_messages": [
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-001",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-17T14:12:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "这条方巾是送姐姐的，包装能简单一点吗？不要太花。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-002",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-17T14:14:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "可以呀许女士。我们有比较简洁的包装方式，礼卡也可以不写内容。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-003",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-17T14:16:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "嗯嗯，那就简单一点。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-004",
      "timestamp": "2025-05-17T14:17:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "谢谢啦～"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-005",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-09T09:30:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "许女士生日快乐！🎂 祝您新的一岁顺顺利利，每天都有好心情。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-006",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-09T10:02:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "谢谢你呀，还记得我生日😊"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-007",
      "timestamp": "2025-11-09T10:05:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "当然记得～今天好好过生日！"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-008",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-18T19:24:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "我自己还有一条丝巾，最近想试试系在包上。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-009",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-18T19:25:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "有没有那种比较简单的系法？我手不太巧哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-010",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-18T19:31:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "有的，我找两个日常一点的给您。其实不用系得特别复杂，简单打个结就挺好看。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-011",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-18T19:35:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "好呀，周末试试。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-012",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-12T16:20:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "对了，我工作日白天开会比较多。之后有事微信给我留言就行，不用特地打电话。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-013",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-12T16:27:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "好的许女士，我记下了。之后优先微信联系您。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C01-014",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-12T16:29:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "好～"
    }
  ],
  "current_client_message": null
}

