Conversation history:
{
  "historical_messages": [
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-001",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T17:42:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "今天店里看的那几个小包，有亮一点的颜色吗？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-002",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T17:46:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "有的，最近有两个颜色还蛮活泼。您想平时背还是周末用？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-003",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T17:48:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "周末吧。平时上班已经够严肃了哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-004",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T17:49:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "不过今天试的那款肩带有点短，我穿外套背不太舒服。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-005",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T17:55:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "嗯，那我给您找两款肩带长一点的。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-006",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-21T15:10:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "林女士，之前您看的小包新到两个颜色，我拍给您看看？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-007",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-21T18:36:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "最近先不买啦，有需要再找你。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-008",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-21T18:40:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "好哒。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-009",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:13:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "最近想找个上班用的包。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-010",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:14:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "有拉链的，logo别太明显。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-011",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:19:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "好的，黑色的有几款。您方便来店里看吗？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-012",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:22:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "黑色或者深棕都行，平时穿黑灰色多。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-013",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:23:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "偶尔要带电脑，不是每天。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-014",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:24:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "但也不想包太重。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-015",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:28:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "那您还是到店试一下比较好，重量光看数据不太直观。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-016",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:31:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "这周真的忙，先微信看吧。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C02-017",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-09T10:32:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "你发两款照片和尺寸给我就行，我先比较一下。"
    }
  ],
  "current_client_message": {
    "message_id": "S2-001-V3-CURRENT",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-13T14:20:00+08:00",
    "sender": "client",
    "text": "这次不装电脑，只放手机、钱包和小雨伞，尽量轻一点。"
  }
