Conversation history:
{
  "historical_messages": [
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-001",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-15T16:34:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "今天看的两款包，皮面处理是一样的吗？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-002",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-15T16:41:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "不完全一样。两款的皮面质感有区别，我整理一下材质说明给您。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-003",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:02:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "结构款的缝线能拍近一点吗？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-004",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:03:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "最好原图，不要滤镜。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-005",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:17:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "可以，我明天到店拍一下。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-006",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:21:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "主要想看边缘和针脚的处理。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-007",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-19T14:28:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "江先生，我拍了几张细节照片，您看看。皮革和缝线部分都拍得比较近。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-008",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-19T15:46:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "看到了。还有内部结构的图吗？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-009",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-19T16:03:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "内部结构您到店看会更直观，照片可能不太容易看清。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-010",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-02T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sender": "advisor",
      "text": "江先生，之前看的那款您还在考虑吗？"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-011",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:04:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "还在比较，不着急决定。"
    },
    {
      "message_id": "MSG-C12-012",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-02T21:05:00+08:00",
      "sender": "client",
      "text": "如果有具体工艺资料可以发我，其他暂时不用。"
    }
  ],
  "current_client_message": {
